 Moisture-wicking work shirts and branded trucks that win the driveway.
 </h2>
 <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
 <p>
 Plumbing and HVAC technicians can face heat, moisture, and frequent customer visits. Bighorn can quote performance work shirts, polos, and button-downs. Product claims come from the manufacturer, and production partners handle approved decoration.
 </p>
 <p>
 Residential service businesses may use magnets, notepads, pens, drinkware, and jackets as part of a follow-up program. Bighorn can coordinate a quoted product mix through selected suppliers and production partners.
 </p>
 <p>
 Common orders: performance work shirts, embroidered polos, branded service-tech jackets, truck magnets, notepads, pens, water bottles, and seasonal promo giveaways.
 </p>
 </div>
 <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
 {['Moisture-Wicking Shirts', 'Embroidered Polos', 'Service Tech Jackets', 'Truck Magnets', 'Branded Notepads', 'Promo Pens', 'Leave-Behind Kits'].map((tag) => (
 <span class="spec border border-hairline px-2.5 py-1 text-ash">{tag}</span>
 ))}
 </div>
