 alt="Concrete and masonry crew gear — heavyweight tee, hi-vis vest, branded white hard hat"
 width="400"
 height="400"
 loading="lazy"
 decoding="async"
 class="h-full w-full object-cover"
 />
 </div>
 <div>
 <span class="spec mb-3 inline-block text-gold-600">Concrete & Masonry</span>
